      "title": "Recast: swap one object in a clip with Wan VACE",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Recast: swap one object in a clip with Wan VACE\n\nFinds the object you name in your clip with SAM 3.1 and renders the object you describe in its place with Wan 2.1 VACE 14B, keeping the rest of the clip. Built from Comfy's template video_wan_vace_inpainting.\n\n## Models\n\n- [sam3.1_multiplex_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/sam3.1/resolve/main/checkpoints/sam3.1_multiplex_fp16.safetensors): SAM 3.1, by Meta, [SAM License](https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam3/blob/main/LICENSE).\n- [wan2.1_vace_14B_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/wan2.1_vace_14B_fp16.safetensors): Wan 2.1 VACE 14B, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Wan-AI/Wan2.1-VACE-14B).\n- [umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors): umt5-xxl text encoder, fp8, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/google/umt5-xxl).\n- [wan_2.1_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors): Wan 2.1 VAE, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
